---
description: Manage Python dependencies and commands with uv.
globs:
  - "**/*.py"
  - "pyproject.toml"
  - "uv.lock"
---

# uv workspace conventions

- Use `uv run` for project commands so they execute in the locked environment.
- Declare runtime dependencies in `pyproject.toml`; update `uv.lock` through uv rather than editing it manually.
- Prefer workspace-aware dependency changes from the repository root.
- Keep supported Python versions and tool configuration in `pyproject.toml`.
- Use `uv sync --all-packages --all-extras` from repo root whenever updating dependencies during development.
